{
  "appid": 1364780,
  "name": "Street Fighter 6",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "系列最新作《Street Fighter 6》将于2023年6月2日发售！ 本作以RE ENGINE开发，并由系列前所未有的大型模式“环球游历”、“斗技战场”以及“格斗中心”构成。新的“Street Fighter”和前所未有的全新体验正在等待着你的到来。",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>Years 1-2 Fighters Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/23a5d054a2a5edb17394dc14f44d18e0.avif?t=1782095044\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>在收录了Year 1及Year 2追加角色和场景的《Street Fighter 6 Years 1-2 Fighters Edition》中展开一场狂热的对战吧！<br><br>■内容<br>・游戏本篇<br>・Year 1 Character Pass<br>・Year 2 Character Pass<br>・Years 1-2 Fighters Edition Stages &amp; Colors</p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1>系列最新作《Street Fighter 6》将于2023年6月2日发售！<br><br>本作以RE ENGINE开发，并由系列前所未有的大型模式“环球游历”、“斗技战场”以及“格斗中心”构成。<br><br>■极具个性的18位FIGHTERS<br>隆、春丽、卢克、杰米、金佰莉等从传奇到新世代的FIGHTER们，带着令人印象深刻的视觉效果和丰富多彩的招式，集结于此。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/1403cce4f5ee33c3a5cd072aa8ef9a99.avif?t=1782095044\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>■称霸这个战斗舞台吧<br>“斗技战场”中不仅有继承自系列的格斗模式，还提供打破指令输入这道墙壁的“Modern”类型操作，以及由AI根据情况作出支援的“动态方式”操作。此外，还配备对战自动实时旁述功能，让你在家中也能体验到犹如置身大赛中的临场感。<br>作为进攻和防守关键的“DRIVE SYSTEM”，能够有效地发动招式，感受华丽的演出和爽快的对战。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/65f6053f32d73fd63f096f6e02e2f935.poster.avif?t=1782095044\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/65f6053f32d73fd63f096f6e02e2f935.webm?t=1782095044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/65f6053f32d73fd63f096f6e02e2f935.mp4?t=1782095044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>■踏上追求强大的冒险<br>在单人游玩的沉浸式故事模式“环球游历”中，玩家可透过丰富的虚拟形象创建功能，创建一个将成为玩家分身的主角，与Street Fighter世界的居民互动，并向隆和春丽等拜师，学习招式，在与各样敌人对战的同时寻找“什么是强大？”这个问题的答案。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/0d370e1a388b09d604499934fea56399.poster.avif?t=1782095044\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/0d370e1a388b09d604499934fea56399.webm?t=1782095044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/0d370e1a388b09d604499934fea56399.mp4?t=1782095044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>■与来自世界各地的FIGHTER互相切磋<br>“格斗中心”是让在“环球游历”中锻炼了的虚拟形象聚首一堂，并可与来自世界各地的玩家互相交流的地方。除了只要坐在对战台就可展开令人热血沸腾的“格斗中心对战”和“极限对抗”外，还可在“街游中心”的游戏机上畅玩Capcom的街机游戏名作！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/100a45536049ecba1cf3db1def2d0471.poster.avif?t=1782095044\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/100a45536049ecba1cf3db1def2d0471.webm?t=1782095044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364780/extras/100a45536049ecba1cf3db1def2d0471.mp4?t=1782095044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>世界战士之路从这里开始。",
